    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23415" root="شوى" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِىٌّ</span></b>  is originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِوْىٌ</span>. (ISd, TA.) One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ بِالعِىِّ وَالشِّىِّ</span>, (S, K,) using the latter noun as
an imitative sequent to the former [for the purpose
of corroboration: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عى</span>]. (TA.)

